    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμελημένως</span></b> , Adv.
		pf.
		part.
		
			Pass.
		 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμελέω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a state of neglect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					8.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.11.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς προῦπτον κίνδυνον ἐκπέμπεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					20.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>with studied neglect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὴν ἠ. πως κοσμήσασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					51.12
				</span></i>
			; <i>carelessly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				28.5
			</span></i>.</div>
